                With native feature tractanda.revision-projection.v1, tractanda_state reports current projection status and a state token without choosing a branch; tractanda_conflicts pages authorized conflicts. An Item DTO has id, revisionId, formatVersion, fields and resolution. Unresolved readable objects remain in list with null revision/content and their authorized resolution; its diagnostic representative locator is never current content. getBounded can additionally return remainingIDs or oversizedIDs. Preserve all of them, compare its state to queryState, and advance query position by consumed query IDs, not by hydrated list length. Use tractanda_resolve_conflict only after reviewing the complete frontier with its expectedStateToken; it creates an explicit resolution and never edits an original branch. Current read permissions still govern all history.
